# Thunderstorm rules index

Non-negotiable principles are in [thunderstorm-based-project.mdc](thunderstorm-based-project.mdc) (lighthouse). This file is the **single routing table** to thunderstorm rules in this submodule.

Read [vocabulary](../.rules/vocabulary.mdc) first for the core mental model. Then use the table below to find the right rule by intent.

Paths are relative to the **monorepo root** (quai-web), unless noted as submodule-relative.

